#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "User Documentation"
msgstr "Användardokumentation"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora&nbsp;Linux"
msgstr "Fedora&nbsp;Linux"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Get an overview about Fedora documentation, get to know how to start using Fedora and maintain your system, fetch the latest information about the currently supported releases, and where to find help in case of difficulties."
msgstr "Få en översikt över Fedora dokumentationen, lär dig hur du börjar använda Fedora och underhåller ditt system, hämta den senaste informationen om de för närvarande stödda släppen och var du kan hitta hjälp i händelse av svårigheter."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora&nbsp;Server"
msgstr "Fedora&nbsp;Server"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Deploy the services you need under your own control, and customized to your own requirements."
msgstr "Rulla ut dom tjänster du behöver under dina egna kontroll, och anpassa till din egna krav."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora&nbsp;CoreOS"
msgstr "Fedora&nbsp;CoreOS"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "A minimal, container-focused operating system, designed for clusters but also operable standalone."
msgstr "Ett minimalt, behållarfokuserat operativsystem, gjort för kluster men kan även fungera självständigt."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora&nbsp;IoT"
msgstr "Fedora&nbsp;IoT"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Foundation for IoT projects at home, industrial gateways, smart cities or analytics with AI/ML."
msgstr "Grund för IoT-projekt i hemmet, industriella gateways, smarta städer eller analys med AI/ML."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora&nbsp;Workstation"
msgstr "Fedora&nbsp;Workstation"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "A reliable, user-friendly, and powerful operating system for your notebook or desktop computer."
msgstr "Ett pålitligt, användarvänligt och kraftfullt operativsystem för din laptop eller stationära dator."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora&nbsp;Atomic&nbsp;Desktops"
msgstr "Fedora&nbsp;Atomic&nbsp;Desktops"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Silverblue, Kinoite, Sway Atomic, Budgie Atomic and COSMIC Atomic are desktop operating systems based on an alternate technology."
msgstr "Silverblue, Kinoite, Sway Atomic, Budgie Atomic och COSMIC Atomic är atomiska skrivbordsoperativsystem baserade på en alternativ teknologi."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Spins&nbsp;&&nbsp;Labs"
msgstr "Spins&nbsp;&&nbsp;Labbar"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "A multitude of GUI variants and purpose-driven customizations of Fedora Workstation."
msgstr "En mängd GUI-varianter och specialdrivna anpassningar av Fedora Workstation."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Quick Docs"
msgstr "Snabbdokumentation"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "How tos and tutorials for using and configuring Fedora Linux."
msgstr "Handledningar och beskrivningar för att använda och konfigurera Fedora Linux."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora Tools"
msgstr "Fedora verktyg"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Documentation of generic Fedora installation and administration tools."
msgstr "Dokumentation av generiska Fedora installation och administrationsverktyg."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "EPEL"
msgstr "EPEL"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Documentation for the Extra Packages for Enterprise Linux (EPEL) project."
msgstr "Dokumentation för Extra paket för Enterprise Linux (EPEL) projekt."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "ARM Single Board Computers"
msgstr "ARM enkorts-datorer"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Use Fedora on the Raspberry Pi and its powerful alternatives."
msgstr "Använd Fedora på Raspberry Pi och dess kraftfulla alternativ."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora Asahi Remix"
msgstr "Fedora Asahi Remix"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Documentation for Fedora Linux on Apple Silicon Macintosh computers."
msgstr "Dokumentation för Fedora Linux på Apple Silicon Macintosh datorer."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora Project &amp; Community"
msgstr "Fedoraprojektet &amp; gemenskapen"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora Project"
msgstr "Fedoraprojektet"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Learn how the Fedora Project works."
msgstr "Ta reda på hur Fedoraprojektet fungerar."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora Council"
msgstr "Fedorarådet"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Learn about the Fedora Project governance."
msgstr "Ta reda på hur Fedoraprojektet leds."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Engineering Teams"
msgstr "Teknikgrupper"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Learn about FESCo and Engineering subprojects, SIGs, Work Groups, and teams."
msgstr "Ta reda på underprojektet FESCo och Teknik, SIG:er, arbetsgrupper och grupper."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Mindshare Teams"
msgstr "Mindshare-grupper"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Activities beyond engineering: Learn about the teams focused on Fedora's outreach, brand, & more."
msgstr "Aktiviteter utöver teknik: lär känna grupperna som fokuserar på Fedoras uppsökande verksamhet, varumärke med mera."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Diversity & Inclusion"
msgstr "Mångfald & inkludering"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "The goal of this initiative is to help foster diversity and inclusion in Fedora community."
msgstr "Målet för detta initiativ är att hjälpa till att fostra mångfald och inkludering i Fedoragemenskapen."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Legal"
msgstr "Juridik"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Policies for licensing, trademarks, and other legal issues."
msgstr "Policyer för licensiering, varumärken och andra juridiska ärenden."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora Packaging Guidelines"
msgstr "Fedoras riktlinjer för paketering"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Learn about packaging for Fedora Linux — from both a policy and a technical perspective."
msgstr "Ta reda på hur paketering för Fedora Linux fungerar — både från ett policy- och ett tekniskt perspektiv."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Program Management"
msgstr "Programhantering"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Release planning, scheduling, and status tracking."
msgstr "Utgåveplanering, schemaläggning och statusuppföljning."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora's Outreachy Docs"
msgstr "Fedoras uppsökningsdokumentation"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Outreachy is an internship program for people from group underrepresented in free and open source software."
msgstr "Uppsökning är ett praktikantprogram för personer från underrepresenterade grupper inom programvara med fri och öppen källkod."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Fedora's Google Project Participation"
msgstr "Fedoras deltagande i Googles projekt"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-docs-masterpagesindex
msgid "Information about Google Summer of Code (GSoC), Google Code In (GCI), and Google Season of Docs (GSoD)."
msgstr "Information om Google Summer of Code (GSoC), Google Code In (GCI) och Google Season of Docs (GSoD)."

