msgstr "Gruppstatus (aktiv eller inaktiv)"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Team's preferred asynchronous communication channel (e.g. mailing list, forum category, etc)"
msgstr "Gruppens föredragna asynkrona kommunikationskanal (t.ex. e-postlista, forumkategori, etc.)"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Team's preferred synchronous communication channel (e.g. IRC channel, Telegram room, etc)"
msgstr "Gruppen föredragna synkrona kommunikationskanal (t.ex. IRC-kanal, Telegram-rum, etc.)"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Team's issue tracker"
msgstr "Gruppens ärendehanterare"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Team's meeting (preferably a link to a Fedocal event, alternatively a static day and time)"
msgstr "Gruppens möten (helst en länk till en Fedcal-händelse, alternativt en statisk dag och tid)"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Additional information the team desires to publish in the directory"
msgstr "Ytterligare information gruppen önskar publicera i katalogen"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "It is expected that not all teams will have answers for the above.  They should be provided when they exist."
msgstr "Det är väntat att inte alla grupper kommer ha svar på ovanstående. De skall ges när de finns."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Content may be stored in the https://pagure.io/Fedora-Council/council-docs[council-docs] repo if the team does not have its own docs repo.  If a team has its own docs repo, the content can be kept in that repo so that it can be used to render the team's own documentation.  This allows for a single source of truth and prevents content from diverging."
msgstr "Innehåll kan lagras i förrådet https://pagure.io/Fedora-Council/council-docs[council-docs] om gruppen inte har sitt eget dokumentationsförråd. Om en grupp har sitt eget dokumentationsförråd kan innehållet sparas i det förrådet så att det kan användas för att visa gruppens egen dokumentation. Detta gör det möjligt att ha en enda källa till sanningen och förhindrar innehållet från att divergera."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Teams are responsible for ensuring their entries are up to date."
msgstr "Grupper är ansvariga för att se till att deras poster är aktuella."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Mechanism"
msgstr "Mekanism"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Team information files"
msgstr "Gruppinformationsfiler"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "The directory requires a file that contains the information about the team.  The suggested naming convention is `NAME_team_info.adoc`, but any valid file name is acceptable.  The file may be stored in the team's own documentation repository or in the https://pagure.io/Fedora-Council/council-docs/[council-docs repository].  See the https://pagure.io/Fedora-Council/council-docs/blob/main/f/engineering/modules/ROOT/partials/TEMPLATE_team_info.adoc[example template] for format and structure."
msgstr "Katalogen förutsätter en fil som innehåller informationen om gruppen. Den föreslagna namnkonventionen är `NAMN_team_info.adoc`, men ett godtyckligt giltigt filnamn är acceptabelt. Filen kan lagras i gruppens eget dokumentationsförråd eller i https://pagure.io/Fedora-Council/council-docs/[förrådet council-docs]. Se https://pagure.io/Fedora-Council/council-docs/blob/main/f/engineering/modules/ROOT/partials/TEMPLATE_team_info.adoc[exampelmallen] för format och struktur."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Rendering the directory"
msgstr "Visa katalogen"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Teams will appear in the directory if the team info file is included in the `{engineering,mindshare}/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc` directory of the https://pagure.io/Fedora-Council/council-docs/[council-docs repo].  After `include`-ing the info file, the index page must include the `team_render.adoc` file that defines the rendering."
msgstr "Grupper kommer dyka upp i katalogen om gruppens informationsfil inkluderas i katalogen `{engineering,mindshare}/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc` i https://pagure.io/Fedora-Council/council-docs/[förrådet council-docs]. Efter att ha`include`:at informationsfilen, måste indexsidan inkludera filen `team_render.adoc` som definierar hur den skall visas."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Reusing the data on team pages"
msgstr "Återanvändning av data på gruppsidor"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagesproceduresteam_directory
msgid "Teams can include their `NAME_team_info.adoc` file on their page(s), and then use `{team_name}`, `{team_summary}` etc. anywhere on the page."
msgstr "Grupper kan inkludera sin fil `NAMN_team_info.adoc` på sina sidor, och sedan använda `{team_name}`, `{team_summary}` etc. var som helst på sidan."

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "Community Publishing Platforms"
msgstr "Gemenskapens publiceringsplattformar"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "image:https://img.shields.io/badge/License-CC%20BY%204.0-lightgrey.svg[License: CC BY 4.0]"
msgstr "image:https://img.shields.io/badge/License-CC%20BY%204.0-lightgrey.svg[Licens: CC BY 4.0]"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "What are Community Publishing Platforms (or, Platforms)?"
msgstr "Vad är gemenskapens publiceringsplattformar (eller plattformar)?"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "*Community Publishing Platforms*, shortened as *Platforms*, are content-focused websites that publish Creative Works with the Fedora Trademark.\nPlatforms are places for expression of ideas and thoughts specifically related to or in the interest of the Fedora Project and its community.\n"
msgstr "*Gemenskapens publiceringsplattformar*, förkortat som *plattformar*, är innehållsfokuserade webbsajter som publicerar kreativa verk med Fedora-varumärket.\nPlattformar är platser för att uttrycka idéer och tankar specifikt relaterade till eller av intresser för Fedoraprojektet och dess gemenskap.\n"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Exempel"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "Creative Works include, but are not limited to, the following examples:"
msgstr "Kreativa verk inkluderar, men är inte begränsade till, följande exempel:"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "Blog posts"
msgstr "Bloggpostningar"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "Pictures or photographs"
msgstr "Bilder eller fotografier"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "Public social media posts"
msgstr "Publika postningar på sociala media"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "Other written communications depending on context"
msgstr "Annan skriven kommunikation beroende på sammanhang"

#. from fedora:fedora-docs-l10n-council-masterpagespolicycommunity-publishing-platforms
msgid "Community Publishing Platforms include, but are not limited to, the following examples:"
msgstr "Gemenskapens publiceringsplattformar inkluderar, men är inte begränsade till, följande exempel:"

